[style]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/bar_english.png" fade="0.0"]
Narrator: As patrons file in, Silem moves gracefully from one to the next, his four arms moving like clockwork to keep the drinks flowing. He obviously has a knack for making people feel welcome.
join Silem center [animation="Slide From Right" length="0.3" wait="true"]
mainChar: Wow. You really have a knack for this.
Silem: Ha, I wish. When you've been running a bar like this for as long as I have, customer service is second nature.
label deep
Silem: We all have our place in the universe. My place is to help everyone else feel all right with theirs.
mainChar: You have this whole solar system. You really feel like the only place for you is behind this counter?
Silem: The solar system might seem big to you, Earthling, but one day you'll realize the truth.
Silem: Which is?
Silem: The bigger your world gets, the easier it is to lose yourself in it.
mainChar: Wow. That's heavy stuff.
Silem: Eh. Not really. It's the same thing on Earth. Pretty much everywhere, really. In fact, that's why I started this bar.
Silem: Folks come here, especially tonight, because they want to feel a real connection between two souls. There's no connection when you're alone on a spaceship, just you and the stars at 80% of the speed of light.
Narrator: Silem glances at the clock.
Silem: Speaking of... Speed dating is about to start. You better find a seat.
leave Silem
Narrator: Thank you for playing! Please remember to fill out the feedback form.
do ScoreManager.reset_swing_downtown()